<title>UK: Goldman places 20 mln BSkyB shrs - dealers.</title>
<headline>Goldman places 20 mln BSkyB shrs - dealers.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs was placing 20 million shares in British Sky Broadcasting Group Plc on Friday at 582p per shares, dealers said.</p>
<p>At 0806 GMT, BSkyB shares were off 3p at 592-1/2, as the broad market surged to fresh peaks.</p>
<p>The benchmark FTSE 100 was up 27.7 points to 4,608.1.</p>
</text>
